name: A single recorded component remains readable without invented data flow
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/component_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 30 Build project context: | inventory
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/component-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Single owned component
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 30 verification verified | verified-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT READY Map ready | awaiting-acceptance
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | accepted-summary
expect: Declared lockfile
expect: no data flows recorded
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/component_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
ask: Does the accepted Map show its known component and source description, with no implied runtime relationships or missing-model claim?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | summary-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | summary-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | summary-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | summary-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | summary-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 shape | summary-shape-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Component map only | summary-unknown-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Declared lockfile | summary-component-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 purpose | summary-purpose-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 dependency declarations | summary-purpose-complete-40x12
ask: Can the component, its purpose and the unknown-flow notice be reached by keyboard at every size, without fabricated topology?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | selected-dfd-node
expect: Declared lockfile
expect: Component map only
expect: 0 flows
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Dependency owner review | linked-context
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 DETAIL | dfd-back
expect: Component map only
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/component_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART alternate
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 Declared lockfile | exact-map-context
expect-not: Alternate metadata label
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/component_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART isolated
ask: Does activating another context outside this TUI preserve the accepted Map and its navigation, without a model request or finding change?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | restored-map
expect: Declared lockfile
expect-not: Alternate metadata label
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/component_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover the accepted single-component context while leaving the alternate active context unchanged?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
